  "events": [
    {
      "month": "1982-11",
      "title": "The recession reaches its low point",
      "description": "US economic activity reaches the turning point later identified by the NBER. That official announcement comes in July 1983.",
      "source_ids": ["nber-1982-trough"]
    },
    {
      "month": "1983-03",
      "title": "A new missile-defense proposal",
      "description": "President Reagan announces a research effort to defend against nuclear missiles. It becomes a major Cold War debate.",
      "source_ids": ["reagan-sdi"]
    },
    {
      "month": "1986-01",
      "title": "Challenger is lost",
      "description": "Seven people die when the space shuttle breaks apart after launch. NASA pauses shuttle flights and investigates.",
      "source_ids": ["nasa-challenger"]
    }
  ],
  "what_happened_next": {
    "text": "The economy began growing again, but you could not have known the turning point on decision day. Over this five-year window, all seven choices gained value. Apple finished ahead of the other six, while the international share basket also rose strongly. The route was not smooth, and choosing a different endpoint could change the ranking.",
    "source_ids": [
      "nber-1982-trough",
      "french-us",
      "french-international",
      "fred-gs5",
      "yahoo-aapl",
      "yahoo-ibm",
      "yahoo-ko"
    ]
  },
  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "Recession, international debt and computer-company competition made the outlook uncertain.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "Each holding compounded along its own path. Broad share baskets spread company-specific risk, but they still moved sharply. Interest paid by cash and bonds also added up over five years.",
    "what_faded_away": "A musical opening and a headline about stolen computer designs were memorable news. Neither told you the five-year ranking of these investments.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "No one could know the exact size or order of the gains in these seven choices. A gloomy starting point did not guarantee a poor five-year result.",
